    "code": "Sub Makro_Format()\nAttribute Makro_Format.VB_Description = \"Kopfzeile formatieren\"\nAttribute Makro_Format.VB_ProcData.VB_Invoke_Func = \"q\\n14\"\n'\n' Makro_Format Makro\n' Kopfzeile formatieren\n'\n' Tastenkombination: Strg+q\n'\n    Range(\"A1:C1\").Select\n    Selection.Font.Bold = True\n    Selection.Font.Italic = True\n    With Selection\n        .HorizontalAlignment = xlCenter\n        .VerticalAlignment = xlBottom\n        .WrapText = False\n        .Orientation = 0\n        .AddIndent = False\n        .IndentLevel = 0\n        .ShrinkToFit = False\n        .ReadingOrder = xlContext\n        .MergeCells = False\n    End With\n    Range(\"B2:B3\").Select\n    Selection.NumberFormat = \"0%\"\n    Range(\"A1\").Select\n    With Selection.Font\n        .Name = \"Calibri\"\n        .Size = 14\n        .Strikethrough = False\n        .Superscript = False\n        .Subscript = False\n        .OutlineFont = False\n        .Shadow = False\n        .Underline = xlUnderlineStyleNone\n        .ThemeColor = xlThemeColorLight1\n        .TintAndShade = 0\n        .ThemeFont = xlThemeFontMinor\n    End With\nEnd Sub",
